abstract: >-
  AI Governance Lab (AIGL) is an open-source benchmark platform for evaluating
  safety risks in long-horizon, weakly-constrained multi-agent social simulations.
  Built on AgentSociety 2 (Tsinghua) with Emergence World social settings,
  it provides: (1) L1 precision-labeled scenarios with ground-truth risk annotations,
  (2) L2 parameterized grid for cross-model statistical comparison,
  (3) L3 open audit on arbitrary simulation runs,
  (4) 6 group behavior statistical indicators (G1-G6) for population-level monitoring,
  (5) causal attribution visualization tracing findings to root causes,
  and (6) NLG-based structured audit report generation.
